d. 28 years later, that boy now a man, Lee Yun-Seon, arrives in Seoul to infiltrate the government and find out the identity of the 5 politicians that gave the elimination order. Yet matters start to complicate themselves when, despite Lee Jym-Pyo's orders to remain detached from people around him, Yun-Seon starts caring for Kim Na-Na, one of the Security Agents for the government.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.4}],"value":8.4,"age":"R"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":995,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}